    "z1": 13260
   },
   "text": "An arm, in a plaid sleeve. Torn off at the elbow.\nThe sawdust round it is soaked through."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 13940,
    "z0": 12070,
    "x1": 20740,
    "z1": 13260
   },
   "text": "Blood, thrown across the boards in a long fan.\nThe saw was running when it happened."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 11900,
    "z0": 11220,
    "x1": 13600,
    "z1": 12240
   },
   "text": "The head saw. There's still a log on the carriage, half cut.\nSomeone threw the belt off to stop the blade."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 19720,
    "z0": 8840,
    "x1": 23120,
    "z1": 10540
   },
   "text": "The water wheel's shaft. It's still turning.\nThe belt's off, so it isn't driving anything."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 7650,
    "z0": 8670,
    "x1": 10710,
    "z1": 10030
   },
   "text": "The log crane, on its track. 5 TON.\nIt could lift anything in this camp, if it had power."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 22100,
    "z0": 15470,
    "x1": 23800,
    "z1": 16320
   },
   "text": "A bloody hand on the back door's frame.\nHe went out this way."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 10880,
    "z0": 19720,
    "x1": 12920,
    "z1": 20740
   },
   "text": "Board feet cut: Monday 4100. Tuesday 3850. Wednesday 1200.\nThen nothing."
  }
 ],
 "entry": "Sawdust, and the smell of blood.",
